ting and leave heavily processed products on the shelf.\n\nImage: showing a picture of emeals 30 minute meal plan image\n\n### 30 Minute Meal Plan\n\nIf you’re exhausted after a long day and don’t quite have the time you need to put an extravagant meal on the table for those hungry mouths, our 30 minute meal plan may be right for you. Scaled up or down for various portions, this plan includes meals with 10 ingredients or less, and it’s perfect for singles, couples, or the entire family. Of course, many meals are one-dish meals or skillet dinners, too.\n\nImage: showing a picture of emeals of heart healthy meal plan recipe by emeals\n\n### Heart Healthy Meal Plan\n\nThis healthy meal plan is our approach to incorporating whole, unprocessed foods into the everyday diet, whether you’re meal planning for one or an entire family. These recipes encourage fresh fruits and vegetables, minimally processed meats and grains, healthy fats, and unrefined foods. Consider choosing this meal plan if you value fresh meals cooked with natural ingredients.\n\nImage: showing a picture of emeals of budget friendly emeals recipe\n\n### Budget Friendly Meal Plan\n\nIf you are looking for ways to save money and still meal plan, this food plan is for you. With fast and affordable brand-new recipes each week, this plan emphasizes freezer-friendly, family- and kid-friendly meals while keeping your grocery budget under $95 per week. Scaled up or down for various portions, this plan includes meals with 10 ingredients or less.\n\nWith fast and affordable brand-new recipes each week, this plan emphasizes freezer-friendly, family- and kid-friendly meals while keeping your grocery budget under $95 per week. Scaled up or down for various portions, this plan includes meals with 10 ingredients or less.\n\nImage: showing a picture of emeals of low calorie meal plan recipe from eMeals\n\n### Low Calorie Meal Plan\n\nThese delicious recipes provide no more than 500 calories per meal. They are compatible with specific diets, like Weight Watchers Smart Points. We offer an accurate nutrition analysis for every meal from our dietitians and food experts. These flavorful, low-calorie recipes are ones you will save for later.\n\nImage: showing a picture of emeals of recipe from the kid friendly meal plan from emeals\n\n### Kid Friendly Meal Plan\n\nWhile we offer many meal plans for families, this is perfect for those picky eaters who love a tasty meal with familiar flavors and textures. These dietitian-approved recipes keep your children’s healthy growth and development in mind by incorporating familiar flavors and nourishing ingredients to put a smile on faces and tummies.\n\nImage: showing a picture of emeals of plant based meal plan recipe from emeals\n\n### Plant Based Meal Plan\n\nThis nutritious meal plan offers a mix of delicious vegetarian and vegan meals focused on whole grains, vegetables, nuts, beans, and fruits. These recipes are great for all populations (vegan, vegan, vegetarian, and everything in between). With our approachable cooking methods, you’ll find some favorites after just one week!\n\nImage: showing a picture of emeals of emeals low carb meal plan recipe\n\nEach plan includes weekly meals, grocery lists, recipes, and more – all specifically designed with busy families in mind.\n\nThey are also updated weekly with new and exciting meal inspiration. Whether you’re looking for healthy options to lose weight or classic favorites to please picky eaters, eMeals makes meal planning easy and fun!\n\n### Can I plan meals to meet my diet goals?\n\nAbsolutely! Our meal plans are designed to help you reach your diet goals. Whether you want to eat healthier, save money, gluten-free, or even go fully plant-based, we have meal plans that fit your needs.\n\nWe also provide nutritional information on all our meals and recipes so you can keep track of your progress. Plus, our flexible search features allow you to customize each of our ingredients for an even more 